  "bodyHash": "vqK4X/rjU8E=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">花卉種子 2</span></h2><hr><p>你是否曾在生存模式中，想用彩色羊毛或混凝土建造一個超棒的家，卻在花費數小時環遊世界收集花朵後放棄？好了！！現在不用再放棄了，因為我開發了一種種植花卉的方法，讓你不必再花費所有時間收集大量花朵或設置骨粉農場！！！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1.20.1 V1.0.0 及以上版本現在包含：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li>村民交易種子</li>\n<li>支援植物盆、熱絕緣器、IE 栽培艙</li>\n<li>花卉現在參考原版模型，因此任何更改花卉模型的資源包都應與作物兼容</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>模組支援</h3><hr><p>模組支援已移至以下列出的獨立模組中。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flower-seeds-2-biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">豐富生態系 (Biomes O Plenty)</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flower-seeds-2-fabulous-flowers\" rel=\"nofollow\">絕妙花卉 (Fabulous Flowers)</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flower-seeds-2-cyclic\" rel=\"nofollow\">循環 (Cyclic)</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flower-seeds-2-roses\" rel=\"nofollow\">玫瑰 (Roses)</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flower-seeds-2-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境 (The Aether)</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5>Discord</h5><hr><p>如果你需要幫助或只是想打聲招呼，請來加入<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finvite.gg%252fcodersdownunder\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;官方 CodersDownUnder Discord 伺服器&nbsp;</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h6><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">花卉種子：1.19x 及更早版本：</span></h6><hr><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你是否曾在生存模式中，想用彩色羊毛或混凝土建造一個超棒的家，卻在花費數小時環遊世界收集花朵後放棄？好了！！現在不用再放棄了，因為我開發了一種種植花卉的方法，讓你不必再花費所有時間收集大量花朵或設置骨粉農場！！！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">要獲得種子，你只需要在合成台或物品欄合成格中將花朵與種子結合，即可獲得對應花朵的 2 顆種子。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">使用種子很簡單，只需在耕地上右鍵點擊，砰！你就在種植花卉了！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">目前這個模組為以下花卉添加了種子和作物：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 蒲公英</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 罌粟</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 藍色蘭花</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 紫頌花</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 藍色小花</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 鬱金香（紅色、橙色、白色、粉色）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 雛菊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 矢車菊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 鈴蘭</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 凋零玫瑰（預設禁用）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">自版本 1.3.0 起，花卉種子支援以下模組：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">循環 (Cyclic)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">未知領域 (Terra Incognita) (1.18)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">噢，你將去的生態系 (Oh the Biomes you’ll go)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">模組展示：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PF54ZhDrchY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
